{"body":{"model":"sonnet","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVP0MHCWDK1SH71DV5"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVP0MHCWDK1SH71DV5"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVK32X6EP1HDF0N9KX"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV14G56RS4XA3G3EYQ"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVNPVPKF5C3P9DMDE8"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV9HC0E6HTYSTY6P2S"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV9D70PPG4K8AH5C24"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVQ9392FS9N1F1RSV0"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV1JFHR47N4WXJRTSC"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVPPXEK3XP5SP1ZGA5"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV0YBVAMA3T9AC95Y2"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVHB1CMYVC42ABP7DS"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV509MPMRSC1K9G5D9"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV6Z8SNBQ8QHHHVJYG"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVT5XCG8B6RTC4XEMG"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVMB85V2R8VX700ZHB"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV4S50EE1DY40XVW4Y"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV0KKHSK9R7Q258HJ0"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVY2VGCK8V2FE68K8H"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVTQGX6MKHBZEG6PYD"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVRT83WT7NKQ4R8Q51"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVGNNWXN6DKR7TYVKW"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV03DG34EEW762D7KW"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVP0MQM4EEG73X9KH9"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVTG44WG5QQTGY0W48"}]},"id":"01M6SD2EMV4SXET0K9P4X5CRTR","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-12","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of each part's own governing survives being made part of a whole","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVK32X6EP1HDF0N9KX"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV9HC0E6HTYSTY6P2S"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV1JFHR47N4WXJRTSC"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV509MPMRSC1K9G5D9"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV4S50EE1DY40XVW4Y"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVRT83WT7NKQ4R8Q51"}],"prose":"The paper is one long attempt to let many self-governing parts, each also a part of something larger, work as a whole without a single ruler. It names the kinds of care a part must carry, the way unlike parts are bound, and the places where this is tried out.","title":"Parts that keep their say, joined without a centre"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVP0MHCWDK1SH71DV5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the balance between local autonomy and the bounds set from above","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV14G56RS4XA3G3EYQ"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVNPVPKF5C3P9DMDE8"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZXGVT2TSASGV9X2TYHX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"}],"prose":"A holon is at once whole and part, stacked in levels, with authority spread rather than gathered; the idea moved from a philosophical image through factory floors to grids, projects and data pipelines.","title":"The nested whole and where it came from"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVK32X6EP1HDF0N9KX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where a part's authority comes from: position versus self","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQKAE5DJFP8AQZCYBJW"}],"prose":"The holon is drawn by contrast with the agent and the flat multi-agent crowd: same autonomy, but position in a hierarchy bounds what each may decide, and humans or orchestrators can sit in the nesting.","title":"The nested form defined against agents"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV14G56RS4XA3G3EYQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the form carries beyond its home domain","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"}],"prose":"From manufacturing's early self-organising resources through energy grids, cyber-physical designs and construction scheduling, the form travels to wherever coordination is wanted without a centre.","title":"A lineage of use"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVNPVPKF5C3P9DMDE8","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which shortfall is being named and what answers it","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV9D70PPG4K8AH5C24"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVQ9392FS9N1F1RSV0"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YN14HRJCEVFSBB1SNPM"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YR2M952H7ZN6R90BBJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YV85BZVM4G694CQKMYX"}],"prose":"Current autonomous systems are brittle when conditions shift, carry unseen bias, lack accountable reasoning and share too little awareness; the nested form, joined to learning twins, is offered as the remedy.","title":"Why the gap is felt"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV9HC0E6HTYSTY6P2S","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the kind of harm a shortfall causes","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"}],"prose":"Brittleness in changing settings, bias from data and design, thin ethical reasoning, and poor shared context, each tied to sensitive domains.","title":"Four shortfalls"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV9D70PPG4K8AH5C24","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether capability can grow without gathering control","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S0919HQTTW5K4S0JD9BAN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S091CAZDYVGXTAQ2RARAAA"},{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S091KTFAT80JBWTQHERM05"}],"prose":"Real-time twins, federated learning and predictive control give parts the data and flexibility to adapt and recover without central oversight, while ethics must be built in once authority is spread.","title":"The promise of pairing with learning twins"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVQ9392FS9N1F1RSV0","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of the simulation's course the parts themselves decide","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVPPXEK3XP5SP1ZGA5"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV0YBVAMA3T9AC95Y2"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVHB1CMYVC42ABP7DS"}],"prose":"The paper carries the family of agent-directed simulation over to holons: parts do not only populate a simulation but can shape how it runs, in degrees from passive to proactive.","title":"Simulation steered by its own parts"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV1JFHR47N4WXJRTSC","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which relation holds between actor and simulation","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"}],"prose":"Simulating agents, agents supporting a run, agents watching a run; simple local rules yielding large patterns; holons added as nested agents, and a new term coined for the step.","title":"Inherited kinds of simulation"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVPPXEK3XP5SP1ZGA5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the degree of initiative a part takes over the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"}],"prose":"Holons may only report, react, learn, or rewrite the rules and objectives across federations.","title":"A ladder of initiative"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV0YBVAMA3T9AC95Y2","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"cost and standardisation against the hoped-for adaptiveness","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"},{"$ref":"01M6S092TSGGXA8WG36SRK5TND"},{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092WW0PH5GJ4A54XXD3EV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092XTJ4DM3B12H6CFN807"}],"prose":"Real-time role adaptation, coordination towards global optima, and the open costs: computation, standards and the tie to twins and learning.","title":"What building it asks"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVHB1CMYVC42ABP7DS","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which care a part carries and how it supports the others","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV6Z8SNBQ8QHHHVJYG"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVT5XCG8B6RTC4XEMG"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVMB85V2R8VX700ZHB"}],"prose":"Each added dimension answers one shortfall by giving some holons a particular care: moral limits, long-run worth, comprehension, fairness, shared watchfulness. They are held to lean on one another and are conceptual roles, not fixed designs.","title":"Five faculties of a part"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV509MPMRSC1K9G5D9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the standard a decision is held to beyond speed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093DCQMTYP12QJRK0KEX9"},{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093QQZ23D7GNGKT5YFGTK"},{"$ref":"01M6S093RJMS7XD707H2868RX0"},{"$ref":"01M6S093RVB5VEFTQ40R9WFVFX"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"}],"prose":"Ethical holons bind decisions by rules and ontologies of principle against efficiency; effective holons weigh long-term and wider consequence against bare efficiency. Both struggle to define and measure their standard.","title":"Care for what is owed and what lasts"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV6Z8SNBQ8QHHHVJYG","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality of knowledge a decision rests on","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09453A04JFE48Z6412NSP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094EZEHMWPGCTN09CMTBK"},{"$ref":"01M6S094G14MVA149MAHGZ3JBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S094GAF5Q516BRBZPKAK33"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"}],"prose":"Understanding holons turn scattered data into situated knowledge through ontologies and reasoning; unbiased holons name and counter known patterns of skew with audits and fairness limits. Both depend on building rich ontologies.","title":"Care for what is known and what is skewed"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVT5XCG8B6RTC4XEMG","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment between local information and global state","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094RFB8ZYRDV9DDW98ERX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VT6R1N5QB4CV4JQNWP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S094Z96KNZDEW5TXAHT8KF"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"}],"prose":"Vigilant holons keep local knowledge aligned with the whole; the faculties then check, inform and watch one another across levels, summarised in a table.","title":"Care for the shared picture, and how all five interlock"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVMB85V2R8VX700ZHB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much common ground is imposed versus negotiated","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV0KKHSK9R7Q258HJ0"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVY2VGCK8V2FE68K8H"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVTQGX6MKHBZEG6PYD"}],"prose":"Parts built by different hands, with different vocabularies, must still meet; the answer is a negotiated, runtime form of interoperability, embodied in a particular connecting holon.","title":"Binding unlike parts with no ruler"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV4S50EE1DY40XVW4Y","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what must be common before parts can speak","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KGFWMBWNW19K2CKDZC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KHNG089YY6CPCTVEGP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095NRWBNYWJEQPXGFXTC5"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"}],"prose":"Incompatibilities are conceptual, organizational and technological, touching data, service, process and business; solutions are one format for all, a shared layer, or transformation between parties with nothing shared.","title":"Kinds of mismatch and three ways of joining"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV0KKHSK9R7Q258HJ0","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of the shared meaning","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S0966QJ26TRP3SYCMVVJ1G"},{"$ref":"01M6S09680J8SGQ5QP5F1RE969"},{"$ref":"01M6S096929EE6AD520SWDPK4N"},{"$ref":"01M6S096B57TAE58492Y73TJPX"},{"$ref":"01M6S096BM94C19GPA5W8TZCDX"},{"$ref":"01M6S096CKGYTCWVA3S2R2HD5Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S096DHFQXC5GW9PKDMVG57"},{"$ref":"01M6S096H49RY8HY208YF1QTMF"},{"$ref":"01M6S096JM086986QX3E3WZWJ1"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"}],"prose":"Joining at runtime, with temporary ontologies used for one exchange and then dropped, lets a newcomer be understood and the whole reconfigure without restart; prior work is cited for support and for domain illustrations.","title":"Meaning made on the spot"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVY2VGCK8V2FE68K8H","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the connector does for the others, and what it declines to do","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VF47NCFNYX301Z8TDD"},{"$ref":"01M6S097ZEDYHSVRT1CRE7YFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0981VVD99XQ72EV84VJE6"},{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"},{"$ref":"01M6S098NTTHF9ESCJ8CYMNPR9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098Q89NK293FCZ3EYNTNC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098WFFJ09R57JCXQAZAM3"},{"$ref":"01M6S098YF407XTYGG61RBEPZ7"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"}],"prose":"A holon set above the faculties to translate, align goals, integrate data, arbitrate and adapt; built of six components led by a language-model orchestrator; placed deliberately at meaning and organization, leaving technical plumbing assumed; limits named.","title":"The connecting holon"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVTQGX6MKHBZEG6PYD","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the abstract roles can be given concrete parts that cohere","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVGNNWXN6DKR7TYVKW"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMV03DG34EEW762D7KW"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVP0MQM4EEG73X9KH9"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EMVTG44WG5QQTGY0W48"}],"prose":"The whole is tried on sparse-area transport: roles mapped onto riders, services and road monitors under the connecting holon, then a standard distributed simulation whose federates mirror and test the live holons, finding places without service.","title":"A trial ground in rural travel"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVRT83WT7NKQ4R8Q51","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the need the case answers","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099CXGHQV3WHYC9KRGE4P"},{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"}],"prose":"Sparse populations, costly services and a call to coordinate modes and locate gaps in service.","title":"The setting and its demands"},"id":"01M6SD2EMVGNNWXN6DKR7TYVKW","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which role does which work in the flow","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3PSM31D58SR50QBDQS"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3Q6P77FKPS24YHHCNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"Each faculty is cast as a concrete actor; requests flow, plans are refined, authority rests with the connecting holon.","title":"Roles mapped onto the transport system"},"id":"01M6SD2EMV03DG34EEW762D7KW","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
